@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userAToken = replace-with-user-a-token
@userBToken = replace-with-user-b-token
@userADocumentId = 1
@userASessionId = 1

### 当前用户本人
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userAToken}}

### 当前用户知识库列表（无 userId query）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases
Authorization: Bearer {{userAToken}}

### P0：userB 不得向 userA 文档创建 chunk，预期 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{userADocumentId}}/chunks
Authorization: Bearer {{userBToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chunkIndex": 99,
  "content": "越权测试，不应写入数据库"
}

### 代表性消息写接口；超过窗口阈值后预期 429
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/sessions/{{userASessionId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{userAToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "USER",
  "content": "限流测试",
  "requestId": "replace-with-unique-request-id"
}

### 退出：预期 200，随后旧 token 请求受保护接口预期 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{userAToken}}
